  m_text: 'NORMAL BLACKJACK RULES

    Betting phase:

    Choose how many chips you want to bet by moving your marker over the bet box. When you are ready, move your marker to the Ready spot and hold it there for 3 seconds.

    Playing phase:

    Hit: shake your phone forwards and backwards. Stand: shake your phone from side to side.

    Double: point your marker at the Double spot. Split: point your marker at the Split spot. You can split only when your first two cards have the same value.'
